  "description_nl": "2026-10-06: every figure Fetch asks for, its shape (kind) and where it lives (targets: chip + path; pick = take that part of the value; archive = before the first change, keep last year's whole param under that param's AY key, as compute.settings regimes_by_ay already does for the CA portal's past years). 2026-10-06: the presumptive-income rules (44ADA / 44AD rates and limits, chip myreturn.business) are fetched and compared too. 2026-10-07: extend - the four due dates take a live-year re-check into close.dates extensions (that year only).",
